<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results on Thursday in</p>
<p>the Pan Pacific Open women's tennis tournament (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Kristie Boogert (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 1-6 6-3</p>
<p>4-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>5-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 7-Irina Spirlea (Romania)</p>
<p>6-4 2-6 6-4</p>
</text>
